  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.38,
      "end_seconds": 8.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Hello doctor, um, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.17,
      "end_seconds": 14.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.64,
      "end_seconds": 20.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "I wanted to get a blocked ear looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.85,
      "end_seconds": 24.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Okay, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.52,
      "end_seconds": 28.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Since Friday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.73,
      "end_seconds": 39.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.7,
      "end_seconds": 50.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "right, it's worse with showering. Moderate, really there's muffled hearing on one side as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.62,
      "end_seconds": 54.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "any a feeling of fullness as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.21,
      "end_seconds": 57.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Yes, for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.77,
      "end_seconds": 63.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "A few quick ones: ear pain, dizziness, discharge or ringing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.79,
      "end_seconds": 71.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "No ear pain, dizziness, discharge or ringing, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.75,
      "end_seconds": 74.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Understood. Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.76,
      "end_seconds": 78.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "No, uh, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.48,
      "end_seconds": 82.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.6,
      "end_seconds": 84.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.65,
      "end_seconds": 87.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.7,
      "end_seconds": 91.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Olive oil drops, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.46,
      "end_seconds": 97.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.35,
      "end_seconds": 101.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.9,
      "end_seconds": 114.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.58,
      "end_seconds": 117.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.93,
      "end_seconds": 122.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.99,
      "end_seconds": 133.65,
      "duration_seconds": 9.66,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. I hardly move around during the day. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.58,
      "end_seconds": 138.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "okay, anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.81,
      "end_seconds": 145.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Yes, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.54,
      "end_seconds": 148.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.35,
      "end_seconds": 158.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "right, keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.34,
      "end_seconds": 179.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, heart rate 83, height 159 centimetres. And temperature 36.8, BP is 116 over 75, weight 92 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.47,
      "end_seconds": 181.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.62,
      "end_seconds": 185.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.43,
      "end_seconds": 192.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.9,
      "end_seconds": 195.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.86,
      "end_seconds": 211.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "there's a lot of wax blocking the right ear canal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.23,
      "end_seconds": 217.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.04,
      "end_seconds": 239.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it fits best with earwax blocking the ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.72,
      "end_seconds": 245.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.31,
      "end_seconds": 274.83,
      "duration_seconds": 28.52,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with earwax blocking the ear do well once it's treated properly we should do ear irrigation for wax use the olive oil drops for a week and then we'll syringe the ear one warning sign to remember: you get ear pain or dizziness in that case don't wait i'd like you back in one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.43,
      "end_seconds": 278.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.09,
      "end_seconds": 284.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.97,
      "end_seconds": 291.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "So, I come back in one week. Is that that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.2,
      "end_seconds": 299.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.16,
      "end_seconds": 303.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
